msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Yasuko「Okay, Ryuu-chan, gotta go～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Bueno, Ryuu-chan, ya me voy～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay. Be careful. If any creepy dudes＿try to talk to you, call my cell.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí. Ten cuidado. Si algún tipo raro＿intenta hablarte, llámame al celular.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Okaaay～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Está bieeen～」"

msgid "Yasuko「Okayyy. The new semester's here＿already, huhhh?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Bueno. Ya llegó el nuevo＿semestre, ¿ehhh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I've been through so much, but I'm＿just glad my memory went back to＿normal before school started.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......He pasado por tanto, pero me＿alegra que mi memoria volviera a la＿normalidad antes de empezar clases.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Huh? It did? Ryuu-chan, your＿memory's back? All of it?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Eh? ¿Volvió? Ryuu-chan, ¿recuperaste＿la memoria? ¿Toda?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I think so.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso creo.」"

msgid "Yasuko「That's greattt! Wow, Ryuu-chan's＿amazing～! Proud of you～!」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¡Qué genial! ¡Vaya, Ryuu-chan es＿increíble～! ¡Qué orgullo～!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's not much to be proud of.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No es nada de qué enorgullecerse.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Sure it is～ Ryuu-chan worked really＿hard～ Ehehe! So happy nooow!」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Claro que sí～ Ryuu-chan se esforzó＿mucho～ ¡Ejeje! ¡Qué feliz estoyyy!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......You need to get going or you'll be＿late.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Tienes que irte o llegarás tarde.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Oh, you're right! Gotta go～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¡Ah, tienes razón! Ya me voy～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Have a good night.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Que pases buena noche.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「The new semester's here......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya está aquí el nuevo semestre......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Starting tomorrow, I'll be seeing＿Kushieda every day......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（A partir de mañana, veré a Kushieda＿todos los días......）」"

msgid "\"......I don't think I should see them.\""
msgstr "\"......No creo que deba verlos.\""

msgid "Ryuuji「（That's what she said that day, I'm sure＿of it. So in other words...... She didn't＿want to hear my confession......?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Eso fue lo que dijo aquel día, estoy＿seguro. En otras palabras...... ¿No＿quiso escuchar mi confesión......?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Did she hate me......? No, that's not it.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Me odiaba......? No, no es eso.）」"

msgid "\"But of course, I shall do my utmost!＿～*Sparkle*～☆\""
msgstr "\"¡Por supuesto, haré mi mayor＿esfuerzo! ～*Brillo*～☆\""

msgid "Ryuuji「（If she hated me, then no matter how＿many times Taiga asked, she wouldn't＿have helped me so much.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Si me odiara, por más que Taiga se lo＿pidiera, no me habría ayudado tanto.）」"

msgid "\"Look, um...... After the Christmas＿party, you did meet up with Ryuuji,＿right?\""
msgstr "\"Mira, ehm...... Después de la fiesta＿de Navidad, te viste con Ryuuji,＿¿verdad?\""

msgid "\"......Yeah, what about it?\""
msgstr "\"......Sí, ¿y qué con eso?\""

msgid "\" 'What about it'......? Didn't something＿happen?\""
msgstr "\"¿'Y qué con eso'......? ¿No pasó＿algo?\""

msgid "\"No, not really.\""
msgstr "\"No, la verdad es que no.\""

msgid "Ryuuji「......Do you want to pretend it never＿happened, Kushieda......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Quieres fingir que nunca＿pasó, Kushieda......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（And that night, she claims she \"didn't＿see\" anything, including my feelings......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Y esa noche, afirma que \"no vio\" nada,＿incluidos mis sentimientos......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That was what she wished for......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso era lo que ella deseaba......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Then what did I bother getting my＿memory back for......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Entonces para qué me molesté en＿recuperar la memoria......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「..................No, that's not it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「..................No, no es eso.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............*Sigh*」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............*Suspiro*」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Now I understand what Kushieda＿wants.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Ahora entiendo lo que quiere Kushieda.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（In that case, I know what I must do......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（En ese caso, sé lo que＿debo hacer......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Inko-chaaan, good morning. Time for＿breakfast!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Inko-chaaan, buenos días.＿¡Hora de desayunar!」"

msgid "Inko-chan「MO, MOR, MORNING」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「BU, BUE, BUENOS DÍAS」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Morning.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Buenos días.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「MORN, NI...... NE......」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「BUE, NOS...... NU......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, it's morning.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, buenos días.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「NE, NEW!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡NU, NUEVO!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Inko-chan「MORNIIIING!!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡¡BUENOS DÍIIIAS!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I-Inko-chan!? H-Hey, don't shout!＿What's the matter!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿I-Inko-chan?! ¡O-Oye, no＿grites! ¡¿Qué te pasa?!」"

msgid "Yasuko「Waaaah～ You woke me uppp～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Aaaah～ Me despertasteee～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sorry Yasuko. Inko-chan's all worked＿up for some reason.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Perdón, Yasuko. Inko-chan está muy＿alterado por alguna razón.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Inko-chan～? What? What＿happeneddd?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Inko-chan～? ¿Qué? ¿Qué pasóoo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I don't know. For some unknown＿reason, it's crazy energetic today.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No lo sé. Por alguna extraña razón,＿hoy tiene muchísima energía.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Hmm～ Reallyyy? Isn't Ryuu-chan the＿energetic one?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Mmm～ ¿En seriooo? ¿No es Ryuu-chan＿quien tiene energía?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Yasuko「Wellll, Ryuu-chan's face looks manly,＿just like his papa's～①」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Bueeeno, Ryuu-chan tiene cara varonil,＿igual que la de su papá～①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Eh?」"

msgid "Yasuko「Ryuu-chan, are you maybe excited for＿the new semester～?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Ryuu-chan, ¿acaso estás emocionado＿por el nuevo semestre～?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wha...... The new semester wouldn't......＿Wait, yeah it would.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Qué...... El nuevo semestre no me......＿Espera, sí me emociona.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Okie-dokieee. Yacchan's all smiles＿when Ryuu-chan looks so cool, gansu.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Entendidooo. Yacchan se pone feliz＿cuando Ryuu-chan luce genial, gansu.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「GE, GET, GOING」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「VA, VAM, VÁMONOS」"

msgid "Yasuko「Yup! Have a good day, Ryuu-chan.＿Yacchan's going back to beddd......＿now...... *Yawn*......」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¡Sip! Que tengas buen día, Ryuu-chan.＿Yacchan vuelve a la camaaa......＿ahora...... *Bostezo*......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay. Well, I'm heading out.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, está bien. Bueno, ya salgo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（My concern for Kushieda is showing＿on my face. I gotta be careful.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Mi preocupación por Kushieda se nota en＿mi cara. Tengo que tener cuidado.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Guess I'll leave a little early......＿There's something I gotta tell Taiga.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Creo que saldré＿un poco antes...... Hay algo＿que debo decirle a Taiga.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Also, the new semester starts＿tomorrow. I'll make you some food, but＿you'll have to reheat it and eat it on」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Además, mañana empieza el nuevo＿semestre. Te prepararé comida, pero＿tendrás que recalentarla y comerla por」"

msgid "Ryuuji「your own.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「tu cuenta.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（But that was the first time I'd seen her＿since the confession...... And yet＿Kushieda seemed as normal as ever......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Pero era la primera vez que la veía＿desde la confesión...... Y Kushieda se＿veía tan normal como siempre......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Hm?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Mmm?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（To experience the shock of heartbreak＿all over again? I wish I'd never＿remembered this desolate）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Para volver a sentir el golpe＿del desamor? Ojalá nunca hubiera＿recordado este vacío）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（emptiness......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（desolador......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（That's not it. I know it isn't. Just＿because the person I loved wouldn't＿accept me, that doesn't mean I'm）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No es eso. Sé que no es así. Solo＿porque quien amaba no me aceptara,＿no significa que esté）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（better off forgetting her.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（mejor olvidándola.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I'm the one who fell in love with＿Kushieda. And even after losing my＿memory, I fell for her again. These）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Yo fui quien se enamoró de Kushieda.＿Y aun tras perder la memoria, volví＿a enamorarme de ella. Estos）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（feelings for her are that strong.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（sentimientos por ella＿son así de fuertes.）」"
